  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pepea Youth-Friendly Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pepea is a #QualityRights compliant user-led youth initiative that seeks to increase access to and uptake of evidence-based youth-friendly services in Nakuru. Services are delivered in a stepped-care approach by trained peers (supervised by specialists) who also lead efforts to challenge mental health stigma and discrimination in their community.</narrative>
  </description>
